---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { CONTACT_EMAIL } from "../site";
const updated = "October 16, 2026";
---

<Base title="Terms of Service" description="The terms for using the KnewCar app and website.">
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="lead">Last updated {updated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section tight">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p>
        These terms govern your use of the KnewCar app and website (the "Service"). By creating an account or using the
        Service, you agree to these terms.
      </p>

      <h2>What KnewCar is, and isn't</h2>
      <p>
        KnewCar is an informational tool that helps you understand new-car manufacturer programs and estimate monthly
        payments. <strong>KnewCar is not a dealer, broker, lender, or financial advisor.</strong> We don't sell vehicles,
        arrange or offer financing, or guarantee any price, rate, payment, or eligibility.
      </p>

      <h2>Estimates are estimates</h2>
      <p>
        Payments and offers shown in KnewCar are estimates based on the information you enter and the manufacturer
        programs available to us at the time. Manufacturer programs change, may have eligibility rules, and may end
        without notice. The final price, rate, term, taxes, fees, and eligibility are determined by the dealer and
        lender. Always confirm details with them before you sign anything.
      </p>
      <p>
        Vehicle images in KnewCar are illustrations and may not match the exact trim, color, or equipment of the
        vehicle you buy or lease.
      </p>
      <p>
        KnewCar is independent and is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by any vehicle manufacturer unless
        we clearly say so. Manufacturer names and trademarks belong to their owners and are used only to identify their
        vehicles and programs.
      </p>

      <h2>Your account</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>You must be at least 18 years old to use KnewCar.</li>
        <li>Give accurate information and keep your password secure. You're responsible for activity on your account.</li>
        <li>You can delete your account at any time from the Profile screen in the app.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Free preview and paid plans</h2>
      <p>
        New accounts can use KnewCar free for a limited preview. After the preview, continued access requires a paid
        plan. Each plan's price, length, and whether it renews automatically are shown clearly before you buy.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Monthly and Yearly</strong> plans renew automatically at the end of each period until you cancel.</li>
        <li><strong>The 3-Month Shopper Pass</strong> is a one-time purchase. It does not renew and is never charged again. It gives
          access for 3 months from the day you buy it, on any device where you sign in to the same KnewCar account.</li>
        <li>If you reinstall the app or switch phones, sign in and tap <strong>Restore</strong> to restore your plan.</li>
        <li>Promotional offer codes are redeemed through Apple and follow the terms shown when you redeem them.</li>
        <li>Purchases in the iPhone app are charged to your Apple ID when you confirm the purchase. A renewing plan is
          charged again within 24 hours before the current period ends unless you turn off auto-renew at least 24 hours
          before then. You can manage or cancel in your Apple ID's subscription settings. Access continues until the
          end of the period you paid for.</li>
        <li>Refunds for app purchases are handled by Apple under its policies.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Prices may change. If the price of a renewing plan changes, you'll be told in advance as required by the app
        store, and you can cancel before the new price applies.
      </p>

      <h2>Apps from the Apple App Store</h2>
      <p>
        If you got the KnewCar app from the Apple App Store, Apple's
        <a href="https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/">Licensed Application End User License Agreement</a>
        governs your license to use the app itself; these terms cover the KnewCar service. These terms are between you
        and KnewCar, not Apple. Apple isn't responsible for the app, its content, maintenance or
        support, or any claims about it, and has no obligation to provide maintenance or support. Apple and its
        subsidiaries are third-party beneficiaries of these terms and may enforce them against you.
      </p>

      <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
      <p>Don't misuse the Service. For example, don't:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Copy, scrape, resell, or redistribute KnewCar data or content.</li>
        <li>Interfere with, overload, or try to gain unauthorized access to the Service.</li>
        <li>Use the Service for anything unlawful.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Our content</h2>
      <p>
        The Service, including its design, software, and the way we organize and present information, belongs to
        KnewCar and is protected by law. We give you a personal, non-transferable right to use it under these terms.
      </p>

      <h2>Disclaimers</h2>
      <p>
        The Service is provided "as is" and "as available." To the fullest extent allowed by law, we disclaim all
        warranties, express or implied, including accuracy, completeness, fitness for a particular purpose, and
        non-infringement. We work to keep information current, but we can't guarantee it is error-free.
      </p>

      <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the fullest extent allowed by law, KnewCar won't be liable for indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or
        punitive damages, or for any loss arising from a vehicle purchase, lease, or financing decision. Our total
        liability for any claim related to the Service is limited to the amount you paid us in the 12 months before the
        claim.
      </p>

      <h2>Ending your use</h2>
      <p>You can stop using KnewCar at any time. We may suspend or end access if these terms are violated or to protect the Service or other users.</p>

      <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
      <p>If we make material changes, we'll update the date above and let you know in the app or by email. Continuing to use KnewCar after that means you accept the updated terms.</p>

      <h2>Governing law</h2>
      <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Texas and applicable U.S. federal law, without regard to conflict-of-law rules.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about these terms? Email <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
